### Test 1: Save - Create polygon
POST {{baseUrl}}/Geofence/save
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "geofenceName": "Planta Central",
  "shape": "P",
  "vertices": [
    {
      "latitude": 14.6349,
      "longitude": -90.5069
    },
    {
      "latitude": 14.6349,
      "longitude": -90.4987
    },
    {
      "latitude": 14.6402,
      "longitude": -90.4987
    }
  ]
}

### Test 2: Save - Create circle
POST {{baseUrl}}/Geofence/save
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "geofenceName": "Cliente 45",
  "shape": "C",
  "latitude": 14.6349,
  "longitude": -90.5069,
  "radius": 150
}

### Test 3: Save - Create rectangle
POST {{baseUrl}}/Geofence/save
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "geofenceName": "Patio",
  "shape": "R",
  "latitude": 14.6402,
