}

### Test 4: Save - Rename only (keeps geometry)
POST {{baseUrl}}/Geofence/save
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "geofenceId": 7781,
  "geofenceName": "Planta Central Norte"
}

